     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜かたわら: in addition to (and at the same time)",
     "texto": [
      "To say that someone devotes themselves to something besides their main activity: noun + **の かたわら**: **しごと の かたわら、 べんきょう を して います** (besides my job, I study).",
      "It is used a lot in biographies."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "With verbs",
     "texto": [
      "It is also used with dictionary-form verbs: **はたらく かたわら** (while working).",
      "It is more formal than ながら."
     ],
